---
interface Props { type: string }
const { type } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['service-art', `art-${type}`]} aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="art-caption">Una idea de lo que es posible</span>
  {type === 'web' && <div class="browser-art">
    <div class="browser-bar"><span class="browser-dots">···</span><span>tuempresa.com</span><span>↗</span></div>
    <div class="browser-body"><span class="mini-brand">Tu empresa</span><span class="browser-menu">Conócenos&nbsp;&nbsp; Contacto</span><p>Un nuevo<br />punto de vista.</p><span class="browser-cta">Conoce lo que hacemos <span>↗</span></span><div class="art-orbit"><div></div></div><span class="browser-foot">Hecho para conectar.</span></div>
  </div>}
  {type === 'flow' && <div class="flow-art">
    <div class="flow-channels"><span>WhatsApp</span><span>Chat</span><span>Voz</span></div>
    <div class="flow-connector"><i></i></div>
    <div class="agent-node"><span class="agent-symbol"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14M5 5l10 10M5 15 15 5" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" /></svg></span><div><strong>Un agente. Más posibilidades.</strong><span>Atención con contexto</span></div><span class="node-light"></span></div>
    <div class="flow-connector"><i></i></div>
    <div class="crm-node"><span>Tu CRM</span><div><span class="crm-line"></span><span class="crm-line"></span><span class="crm-line"></span></div><span class="crm-state">Todo en el mismo lugar</span></div>
  </div>}
  {type === 'data' && <div class="data-art">
    <div class="document-art"><span class="doc-fold"></span><span>Documento</span><div class="doc-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="scan-line"></div></div>
    <div class="data-result"><span class="result-label">OCR</span><strong>Información<br />lista para trabajar.</strong><span class="result-detail">Extraer · Ordenar · Conectar</span></div>
    <div class="nfc-card"><span class="nfc-brand">canario<br />studios</span><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" width="38" height="38"><path d="M15 15q6 5 0 10m6-16q13 11 0 22m6-28q20 17 0 34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /></svg><span class="nfc-caption">Un toque. Una conexión.</span></div>
  </div>}
</div>
